# The two-card comparison, round 1 of 3, and the sweep's confirmation, round 1 of 5 (rg-r4 and rg-r5 end it), on a
# fresh sample of the agents (seed 21):
# each card's part of every arrangement in benchmarks/quality/RESOURCE-GATE.md as a point of its own (voice alone with
# two callers and with one, the agents alone on the frozen box and on the agents-only card, one caller beside 12
# session trees on the frozen box and on the change at a step cap of 256, two callers beside 12 on both, a consolidated
# card at half the agents, and two callers beside 24 on the change at 256, on the frozen box and on W5's 48-token
# configuration). Round N runs its engine groups in an order rotated by one from round to round, on the GPU node
# FLATSHARE_GPU names, the rounds' nodes swapped between rounds.
#   FLATSHARE_GPU=NODE benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh --pause benchmarks/e2/rg-r1.campaign

agents-seed 21

# engine frozen
arms/w5-a1-voice.toml
arms/rg-voice-c1.toml
arms/rg-disc-agents-frozen-s24.toml
arms/rg-disc-frozen-c1-s12.toml
arms/rg-disc-frozen-s12.toml
arms/w5-disc-frozen-s24.toml

# engine agents-only
arms/rg-disc-agents-only-s24.toml

# engine make-room --additional-config.make_room.reserve_tokens 0 --additional-config.make_room.budget_cap_tokens 48
arms/w5-disc-pr-ab48-s24.toml

# engine make-room (48-token window) --max-num-batched-tokens 256 --long-prefill-token-threshold 0
arms/rg-disc-pr-ab48-b256-c1-s12.toml
arms/rg-disc-pr-ab48-b256-s12.toml
arms/sweep-disc-pr-ab48-b256-t0-s24.toml
